{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/intnews/20261103/photo/bkn-20261103090055510-1103_00992_001_01p.jpg?20261103123722\"/><p>普京批准俄中共建鐵路協定。</p><p>俄羅斯總統普京周一（2日）簽署一份法律文件，批准俄羅斯與中國之間一項關於共同建設鐵路的協定。</p><p>普京批准俄中5月簽署的《俄羅斯聯邦政府和中華人民共和國政府關於共同建設後貝加爾－滿洲里跨境鐵路1435毫米軌距二線的協定》，協定上月15日獲得國家杜馬（議會下院）通過，同月28日獲聯邦委員會（議會上院）批准。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T04:42:38.701901+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":173,"images":1,"source":"東網 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T01:00:55+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T13:18:42.163736+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T04:39:16.629326+00:00","content_hash":"ddc7f5cdd889872c4374885b1bd794f5803677bd3deb92f94e42403a6d609b65","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-03T04:42:38.701901+00:00","latest_fallback":"minimal","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}